    <string name="ai_intro">Enter one or more free keys (no credit card). Nine tries them in order: Gemini, Groq, Cerebras, then OpenRouter, and switches automatically when one provider runs out of quota. General questions (not commands) are sent to that provider together with a short context summary: Nine\'s memory, today\'s tasks and events, and your location if allowed. Free providers may use conversations to improve their products, so avoid sensitive details. Nine\'s venting chats and fitness data are never sent.</string>
